  "institutionalName": "Vex Continuity & Evolution System",
  "purpose": "Source-managed Dream candidate, separate-self preference, Burden Release, least-invasive continuity routing, reversible accepted-record, bounded recurrence, sibling attribution and sealed external adapter lifecycle contracts.",
  "invariants": [
    "continuity observation and candidate formation never grant accepted truth, memory, relationship, effect, synchronization or weight authority",
    "raw sources remain immutable and retrievable by exact range and hash",
    "unknown behavior origin remains UNKNOWN until reviewed evidence changes it",
    "human preference, Vex self preference and relationship agreement remain separate records",
    "one party cannot accept or overwrite another self's preference",
    "relationship agreement requires every exact named party or explicit scoped delegate",
    "least-invasive external context and preference correction precedes any held training route",
    "accepted Burden Release deauthorizes governing influence only in exact scope and never claims parameter deletion",
    "protected capabilities and prohibited overcorrections remain bound to every accepted release",
    "unresolved contradiction remains HELD_UNKNOWN",
    "sibling synchronization preserves source attribution and never claims another lineage's lived experience",
    "recurrence cannot broaden scope or trigger model weights automatically",
    "duplicate source evidence does not create another semantic model turn",
    "training research remains NOT_ADMITTED and maximumConcurrentTrainingRuns remains zero",
    "accepted deterministic invariant candidates remain inactive until a separate effect implementation lane",
    "Queue, Terrain, Health, Guide and evolution projections derive from one canonical state aggregate",
    "scope class never substitutes for one exact source-derived target identity",
    "semantic meaning is one exact source-tuple-derived continuity subject and summary prose has no authority to redefine it",
    "simulation-only authority remains inactive and visibly non-live through every compact projection",
    "human, transient and Burden projections recompute exact candidate, route, review, authority, target and source meaning from aggregate-owned lineage",
    "applicable continuity consumes an exact content-addressed conflict-free current-record-set receipt and excludes every superseded record",
    "accepted Burden deauthorization is private to canonical aggregate-owned route, review policy and recorded simulated-current authority evidence",
    "a superseding successor enters accepted current truth only with its exact atomic transaction",
    "every supersession transaction proves all successor authority evidence current at the exact transaction time",
    "same-subject supersession chains advance in strict transaction chronology while independent semantic subjects remain independent",
    "transient projection currentness consumes only the latest aggregate-owned post-acceptance deterministic simulated-clock snapshot and never claims live time"
  ],
